# The seed's fixture photos: a local, untracked set of ~90 real photographs
# (13 MB, some carrying EXIF/GPS). `scripts/seed.ts` takes the largest ones when
# the directory is there and skips photos when it is not, so a checkout without
# them still seeds a full catalog. Delete this line to track the set instead.
/apps/api/scripts/seed/images/

